1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,600
Skip the Great Wall crowds — the wall you can ride all the way around is in Xi'an.
{\fs13}I'm your China Travel Expert

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:07,200
Xi'an's Ming city wall: 13.7 km around, about 12 m tall, built in the 1370s.

3
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:10,800
It's the most complete ancient city wall left in China — a full rectangle.

4
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:14,200
Rent a bike up top and loop the whole thing in roughly 90 minutes.

5
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:17,800
Great Wall day trip, or a sunset lap up here — which wall wins your Xi'an day?
